{"availability":"available","full":"vicanso/charts-rs","name":"charts-rs","description":"A charts library for rust","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":329,"forks":21,"created":"2023-03-28T11:19:46Z","updated":"2026-10-04T06:16:53Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://charts.npmtrend.com/","topics":[],"demo":"https://charts.npmtrend.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:47.704Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:47.704Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:47.704Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:50:47.704Z","stars":329,"forks":21}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["charts-rs is a charting library for rust. It's simple and fast.","charts-rs provides a straightforward approach to generating charts with support for multiple output formats including svg, png, jpeg, webp, and avif. The library offers ten distinct themes: light, dark, grafana, ant, vintage, walden, westeros, chalk, shine, and shadcn, with light as the default theme.","The library supports twenty-five chart types: Bar, HorizontalBar, Line, Pie, Radar, Scatter, Candlestick, Table, Heatmap, Funnel, Waterfall, MultiChart, Calendar, Gauge, Treemap, BoxPlot, Sunburst, Sankey, Tree, Graph, Parallel, ThemeRiver, Histogram, PolarBar, and Chord. Drawing inspiration from Apache ECharts, charts-rs enables developers to create charts with similar functionality and appearance."],"features":["Ten built-in themes; custom themes supported via addtheme()","Custom font loading from ttf or otf files","Advanced line chart features: smooth curves, area filling, mark points and mark lines","Multiple legend styles across all charts: round rect, circle, and rect","Dual y-axis support via yaxisconfigs and series.yaxisindex"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vicanso/charts-rs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"b5833be9afb3ebda8df19ff0f4f7af5c8ffcd778af89c215d70ec73bcdac0923","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:47.815Z"},"ov